<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ M-3 money supply unchanged in February.</title>
<headline>NZ M-3 money supply unchanged in February.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Thursday released the following estimated money supply figures for February.</p>
<p>    M3		     Feb 1997     Jan 1997	 Feb 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	  0.0 pct    -1.4 pct	  +0.8 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +10.9 pct   +11.9 pct	+11.7 pct</p>
<p>    PSC		    Feb 1997     Jan 1997	 Feb 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 +0.5 pct     +2.2 pct	 +1.1 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change   +12.5 pct    +13.1 pct	+14.6 pct</p>
<p>    M1		     Feb 1997     Jan 1997	 Feb 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 -0.7 pct     +2.6 pct	 -4.9 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +6.0 pct     +1.5 pct	 +1.0 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
</text>
